<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Email Verification - AmbuLink</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <h2>Welcome to AmbuLink</h2>
    <p>Hello <%= name %>,</p>
    <p>Thank you for registering with AmbuLink. Use the OTP below to verify your email address.</p>
    <h1><%= otp %></h1>
    <p>This OTP will expire in <%= expirationMinutes || 5 %> minutes.</p>
    <p>If you did not create an account, you can ignore this email.</p>
    <p>Regards,</p>
    <p>AmbuLink Team</p>
  </body>
</html>